WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.213
What this proves.

2
00:00:01.213 --> 00:00:06.580
Every active HR record has its accounts,
every terminated one has none enabled,

3
00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:11.535
and every enabled account belongs to
a person: account management, AC-2,

4
00:00:11.535 --> 00:00:16.325
and the workbook's leaver and orphan
measures, kept as each run's output.

5
00:00:16.325 --> 00:00:20.778
Drift is measured on a schedule, and
what changed between runs is reported:

6
00:00:20.778 --> 00:00:23.625
continuous monitoring
and system monitoring.

7
00:00:23.625 --> 00:00:26.362
And what wasn't measured
is stated, not implied,

8
00:00:26.362 --> 00:00:29.675
which feeds the workbook's
detection coverage measure.

9
00:00:29.675 --> 00:00:33.310
The not-computed list and the
refusal are that evidence.
